(text "24 V arrives from the panel XT90 and 7 A breaker on J1. The plug-in power module (PM1) carries the TPS2663 eFuse and the TPS7A4901." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 03f92d07-7000-41cb-9f28-b41b48bb78dd))
(text "PM1 returns protected +24V, and makes +5VA (analog 5 V) from +12V. Its eFuse fault and current-monitor outputs go to the expander and ADC #2." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7c06b82e-563b-484f-ba4b-0b2e8004ed03))
(text "Pololu D24V22Fx pinout confirmed from the board: PG, EN, VIN, GND, VOUT (1-5) plus a corner GND (6). EN and PG unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0e78340f-ebbb-47c6-a39f-ad6a706a8ab3))
(text "LM1117: tantalum (or ESR-specified) 10 uF on input and output, per the TI datasheet." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b9dfa813-7ec3-4cfc-ab55-359906d29a81))
(text "+24V_FIELD feeds limit switches, the orifice selector and the E-stop status contact, through a 0.1 A PTC." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0b3b8007-d764-4119-91fb-5213c88c5d40))
(text "Test points: 24 V area (supply, stepper and coil feeds) kept apart from the logic-supply area." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9ff589d6-25ba-42e3-a60f-53011887241e))
